SUMMARY:GTApreneurs August 12-2026 Afternoon Virtual Business Networking E
 vent Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\n\\*\\*You n
 eed to register on our website to attend this event and get the link. RSVP
 ing on Meetup does not mean that you are registered\, even though Meetup.c
 om will send you an email saying that you have. Thank you. Please go here:
  https://gtapreneurs.com/networking-events-toronto\n\n\\*Please note this 
 event is advertised on multiple platforms\, and we expect around 20-25 gue
 sts.\n\nDo you want more clients? Join us for GTApreneurs August 12-2026 A
 fternoon Virtual Business Networking Event to connect with other amazing e
 ntrepreneurs\, learn something new and promote your business!\n\n**WARM-UP
  ITINERARY:**\n\n* **[11:45am-12pm: Pre-event networking]**\n* **12:00-12:
 10pm:** GTApreneurs welcoming presentation\n* **12:10-12:30pm:** Featured 
 Presentation by Tammy Defoe\, ***“How to Make Your Best Elevator Pitch
 ”***\n* **12:30-1:00pm:** Elevator Pitches (45 seconds each)\nFree\n\n**
 PREMIUM EVENT ITINERARY:**\n\n* **[11:45am-12pm: Pre-event networking]**\n
 * **12:00-12:10pm:** GTApreneurs welcoming presentation\n* **12:10-12:30pm
 :** Featured Presentation by Tammy Defoe\, ***“How to Make Your Best Ele
 vator Pitch”***\n* **12:30-1:00pm:** Elevator Pitches (45 seconds each)\
 n* **1:00-2:00pm:** Breakout rooms (Network 1-1 with other guests)\n\n**TI
 CKETS**\n**GTApreneurs' Referral Group\, Exhibitor and Mega Networking Mem
 bers:** Free\n**Non-members:** $10\n\\*Premium ticket includes Guest Conta
 ct sheet emailed to you after the event. Note: You must attend the event t
 o receive the guest contact sheet.\n\nThis event will feature our Presiden
 t of GTApreneurs\, **Tammy Defoe**\, who excels at helping entrepreneurs g
 et more exposure and more clients. She is a Business Coach and Consultant 
 specializing in business development\, sales\, marketing\, digital marketi
 ng\, public speaking\, business communication and networking.\n\nVisit htt
 ps://gtapreneurs.com/about and https://gtapreneurs.com/business-coaching-t
 oronto for more information about Tammy and her Business Coaching and Cons
 ulting services.\n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT?**\nContact **Tammy** at (
 416) 522-7770 or info@gtapreneurs.com or book a video consultation with he
 r here: https://calendly.com/gtapreneurs\n\nWant to attend the Premium ver
 sion of our Virtual Networking Events for FREE? Become a Member. Learn mor
 e at https://gtapreneurs.com/business-networking-memberships
