SUMMARY:GTApreneurs August 13\, 2026 Business Networking Event Pickering
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\nJoin us for
  an exciting Business Networking Event at CASUAL restaurant at Pickering C
 asino Resort on Thursday August 13\, 2026 where you can mix n mingle with 
 other friendly entrepreneurs and small business owners who may become your
  clients or referral partners.\n\n***Appetizers provided. \\*Cash bar.***\
 n\nThis is casual\, social networking event where you can stand or sit to 
 connect with new people or with familiar faces. We will start with ice bre
 akers to ease into the open networking. We will provide you with a Guest C
 ontact Sheet by 5pm the day after the day\, but\, bring your business card
 s to share too. It will help those you meet to remember you.\n\n**REGISTER
  HERE:** https://gtapreneurs.com/business-networking-events-pickering\n\n*
  **TIME:** 6:00-8:30pm\n* **VENUE:** CASUAL Restaurant\, Pickering Casino 
 Resort\n* **ADDRESS:** 888 Durham Live Ave\, Pickering\, ON\n* **PARKING:*
 * Free\, onsite\, park in front of the main entrance\n\n**EVENT ITINERARY:
 **\n\n* **6:00-6:30pm:** Open networking + appetizers + buy your own bever
 age\n* **6:30-7:30pm:** 1-1 Speed networking 3 minutes/table then rotate\n
 * **7:30-8:30pm:** Open networking\n\n**TICKETS**\n\n* **GTApreneurs Membe
 rs:** Free\n* **Non-members:** $20 in advance or $25 on event day\n\n**QUE
 STIONS ABOUT THE EVENT?**\nCall or text **Yolande** at 705-710-9026 or ema
 il mmlf-info@consultant.com\n\nNot a GTApreneurs Member? Go here to view o
 ur memberships and register: https://gtapreneurs.com/business-networking-m
 emberships
